                                "example_id": "7668bfe9-0dc1-45f1-a9f5-a8e029c8aeec",
                                "sense_id": "447f5f36-8021-3789-8878-16546e5705c9",
                                "text": "Am Tag der Wiedervereinigung, der Einheit also, lud Talkmaster Markus Lanz mit Alexander Gauland einen Mann in seine Sendung, der vehement an einer Spaltung der Gesellschaft arbeitet; der zudem ein ausgewiesener Rassist ist; der dazu anhält, stolz auf die Leistungen der deutschen Soldaten in beiden Weltkriegen zu sein.",
                                "translation": "On German Unity Day, talk show host Markus Lanz invited Alexander Gauland onto his show, a man who works vehemently to divide society; who is also a proven racist; who encourages people to be proud of the achievements of German soldiers in both World Wars.",
                                "english": "On German Unity Day, talk show host Markus Lanz invited Alexander Gauland onto his show, a man who works vehemently to divide society; who is also a proven racist; who encourages people to be proud of the achievements of German soldiers in both World Wars."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
